252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (After reading the first chapter of the story, I made three predictions about life in 2123. First, Joe had trouble finding a clean place to swim in 2023. I predicted that in 2123, there would probably be ways to clean the ocean. After reading, I learned this was correct because they had machines that made clean water everywhere! Second, Joe faced traffic problems on the way to work. I suspected that in 2123, there would be flying cars. This prediction was right because Joe traveled in a flying car. Lastly, Joe worried about world hunger. I predicted that in 2123, world hunger would not be solved. After finishing the story, I found out this was false because special machines grew food fast and helped end hunger! )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
