696 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 158 0 R
/T (Model Response:  "The city is crowded and noisy; however, the countryside is quiet and open. Although people live in both places, they live much closer together in the city. If you live in the countryside, you may need to drive very far to get to a hospital or movie theater, but if you live in the city, those places are usually close by. The air can get quite polluted in the city but in the countryside it is usually much cleaner. Some people think there are way more fun things to do in the city; however, some people think living in the countryside is much more fun.")
/E (Model Response:  "The city is crowded and noisy; however, the countryside is quiet and open. Although people live in both places, they live much closer together in the city. If you live in the countryside, you may need to drive very far to get to a hospital or movie theater, but if you live in the city, those places are usually close by. The air can get quite polluted in the city but in the countryside it is usually much cleaner. Some people think there are way more fun things to do in the city; however, some people think living in the countryside is much more fun.")
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
