/Title (Animals can be divided into two main categories: sea animals and land animals. Sea animals live in the ocean, lakes, or rivers. Some examples are fish, whales, sharks, and dolphins. These animals have special body parts to help them swim, like fins and tails. Another type of animal is land animals. They live on the land, in forests, deserts, or jungles. Examples of land animals include lions, elephants, dogs, and birds. Animals in this group have legs for walking and many have fur or feathers to keep them warm.)
